# Quick-edit · Option A — per-cell inline (toggle)  ★ recommended

A **Quick edit** toggle in the toolbar flips table cells into inline editors. Off = today's
behavior (click row → detail). On = click a cell to edit; each edit autosaves on blur/Enter.

