## Interaction
- One field per edit → `updateInstance(id, version, { [fieldId]: value })`.
- Optimistic local write, reconciles via the live SSE collection. Version clash → cell flags + refetch.
- Editors reused from `InstanceForm.renderInput`: bool=checkbox · enum=dropdown · user=member picker
  · number/text/date inputs. **computed** cells = read-only; **relation/file** aren't columns (edit in detail).

**Fork this represents:** entry = dedicated *toggle* (resolves the row-click↔edit conflict) + per-cell autosave.
